  lines:
  - speakerName: Gedas
    sentence: Listen closely... and keep your voice down. Evil doesn't just lurk
      here; it blends in. Most of us are dead; the rest... well, the rest were unlucky
      enough to survive. Their minds snapped before the blackness claimed them. If
      you see a familiar face, run. They aren't themselves anymore
    hasChoices: 0
